1
00:06:12,857 --> 00:06:18,857
Seventh Moon is a horror, thriller film directed by Eduardo Sánchez.

2
00:12:25,714 --> 00:12:31,714
Melissa and Yul, Americans honeymooning in China, come
across the exotic 'Hungry Ghost' festival.

3
00:18:38,571 --> 00:18:44,571
When night falls, the couple end up in a remote village,
and soon realize the legend is all too real.

4
00:24:51,428 --> 00:24:57,428
Plunged into an ancient custom they cannot comprehend, the couple must
find a way to survive the night of the Seventh Moon.

5
00:31:04,285 --> 00:31:10,285
Ping, played by Dennis Chan Kwok-San.

6
00:37:17,142 --> 00:37:23,142
Yul, played by Tim Chiou.

7
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:36,000
Melissa, played by Amy Smart.

8
00:49:42,857 --> 00:49:48,857
Seventh Moon is a 2008 American horror film written by Eduardo
Sánchez and Jamie Nash, and directed by Eduardo Sánchez.

9
00:55:55,714 --> 00:56:01,714
Part of Robert Tapert's Ghost House Underground DVD
series, and entirely shot in shaky cam style.

10
01:02:08,571 --> 01:02:14,571
The film is based on the Chinese legend that on the full moon of the seventh lunar month,
the gates of hell open and the dead can enter the realm of the living.

11
01:08:21,428 --> 01:08:27,428
It stars Amy Smart as an American woman who is spending her honeymoon
in China with her newlywed Chinese-American husband.

12
01:14:34,285 --> 01:14:40,285
While driving through the countryside the couple gets stranded and
has to find a way to survive the fateful night.

13
01:20:47,142 --> 01:20:53,142
The tone is dark and intense.
